          {
            "title": "Question: Both conditions",
            "id": 95807,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>AND</code> ile zincirlenmiş koşullarla filtreleme yapıldığında hangi öğeler seçilir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tüm koşulları karşılayan öğeler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bir veya daha fazla koşulu karşılayan öğeler</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hiçbir koşulu karşılamayan öğeler</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tüm koşulları karşılayan öğeler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>AND</code> ile birleştirilen koşulların tümü doğruysa satır seçilir.</p><p>Bir kitap ilk filtreyle eşleşiyor ancak <code>AND</code> ile birleştirilen ikinci filtreyi geçemiyor. Kitap seçilir mi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, iki filtreyi de karşılaması gerekir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, bir filtreyle eşleşmesi yeterlidir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Evet, AND ikinci filtreyi yok sayar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, iki filtreyi de karşılaması gerekir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Comparisons",
            "id": 95812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>AND</code> operatörünü kullanarak <code>year</code> değerinin <code>2000</code>'den küçük olduğu kayıtları da filtrelemek için bir koşul zincirle.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE books (&#xA; title varchar(255),&#xA; year int,&#xA; genre varchar(255)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Ulysses', 1992, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Sapiens', 2011, 'non-fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Beloved', 1987, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('The Prince', 1532, 'non-fiction');\"><tables><table name=\"books\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre = \" /><text value=\"'non-fiction'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"64\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>AND year &lt; 2000</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Equivalent to BETWEEN",
            "id": 95810,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>year &gt; 1800 AND year &lt; 1900</code> ifadesini <code>BETWEEN 1800 AND 1900</code> ile değiştirebilir miyiz?<br /></p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1800\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" ;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, bunun mümkün olması için operatörlerin <code>&gt;=</code> ve <code>&lt;=</code> olması gerekirdi.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, ikisi eşdeğerdir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, <code>BETWEEN</code>'i sayılarla kullanamayız</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, bunun mümkün olması için operatörlerin <code>&gt;=</code> ve <code>&lt;=</code> olması gerekirdi..</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sorgu 1800 ve 1900 yıllarını hariç tutuyor. Hangi değişiklik eşdeğer bir <code>BETWEEN 1800 AND 1900</code> koşulu sağlar?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"1800\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" ;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">İki koşulda <code>&gt;=</code> ve <code>&lt;=</code> kullanmak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">BETWEEN uç değerleri hariç tuttuğu için <code>&gt;</code> ve <code>&lt;</code> operatörlerini korumak</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>AND</code> yerine <code>OR</code> kullanmak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">İki koşulda <code>&gt;=</code> ve <code>&lt;=</code> kullanmak.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: IN, BETWEEN, and LIKE 2",
            "id": 95813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu sorgu ne tür öğeleri seçer?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>title</code> değeri <code>a</code> içeren ve <code>year</code> değeri <code>2019</code> veya <code>2020</code> olan öğeler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>2019</code> veya <code>2020</code><code>year</code> değerine sahip öğeler</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>a</code> içeren bir <code>title</code>'a sahip öğeler</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>title</code> değeri <code>a</code> içeren ve <code>year</code> değeri <code>2019</code> veya <code>2020</code> olan öğeler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>LIKE '%a%'</code>, <code>a</code> içeren metinlerle eşleşir. Her <code>%</code>, sıfır veya daha fazla karakterle eşleşir.</p><p>Bir kitabın başlığında <code>a</code> var ancak kitap 2018’de yayımlanmış. Gösterilen sorgu kitabı seçer mi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"2019\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, yılı 2019 veya 2020 değildir</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, başlığı LIKE ile eşleşir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Evet, LIKE yıl filtresini yok sayar</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, yılı 2019 veya 2020 değildir.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: IN, BETWEEN, and LIKE",
            "id": 95811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>'f%'</code> desenini ve <code>AND</code> operatörünü kullanarak <code>genre</code> değerinin f ile başlayıp başlamadığını kontrol eden bir koşul zincirle.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE books (&#xA; title varchar(255),&#xA; year int,&#xA; genre varchar(255)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Ulysses', 1992, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Sapiens', 2011, 'non-fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Beloved', 1987, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('The Prince', 1532, 'non-fiction');\"><tables><table name=\"books\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1900\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'f%'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"73\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>AND genre LIKE 'f%'</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: At least one condition",
            "id": 95898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu sorgu, <code>genre</code> değeri <code>'non-fiction'</code> olan öğeleri seçer mi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre = \" /><text value=\"'fiction'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2011\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><data content=\"No result!\" /></row></table></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Evet, bu öğeler <code>year = 2011</code> koşulunu sağlıyorsa</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, çünkü öğelerin tüm koşulları karşılaması gerekir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Evet, çünkü sorgu tablodaki tüm öğeleri seçiyor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Evet, bu öğeler <code>year = 2011</code> koşulunu sağlıyorsa.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kurgu dışı bir kitap 2011'de yayımlanmış. Gösterilen <code>OR</code> sorgusu bu kitabı seçer mi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre = \" /><text value=\"'fiction'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2011\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Evet, çünkü <code>year = 2011</code> koşulunu karşılar</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, çünkü türü kurgu değildir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, çünkü iki OR koşulunun da eşleşmesi gerekir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Evet, çünkü <code>year = 2011</code> koşulunu karşılar.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: The logical operator OR",
            "id": 95901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sorgunun, <code>genre</code> değeri <code>'fiction'</code> olan veya <code>year</code> değeri <code>2011</code> olan öğeleri seçtiğinden emin ol.</p><database visible-if=\"always\" bootstrapScript=\"CREATE TABLE books (&#xA; title varchar(255),&#xA; year int,&#xA; genre varchar(255)&#xA;);&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Ulysses', 1992, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Sapiens', 2011, 'non-fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('Beloved', 1987, 'fiction');&#xA;&#xA;INSERT INTO books(title, year, genre)&#xA;VALUES ('The Prince', 1532, 'non-fiction');\"><tables><table name=\"books\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Prince\" /><data content=\"1532\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row></table></tables></database><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" genre = \" /><text value=\"'fiction'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2011\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"59\" /></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"title\" /><header content=\"year\" /><header content=\"genre\" /></row><row><data content=\"Ulysses\" /><data content=\"1992\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Sapiens\" /><data content=\"2011\" /><data content=\"non-fiction\" /></row><row><data content=\"Beloved\" /><data content=\"1987\" /><data content=\"fiction\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>OR year = 2011</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: IN, BETWEEN, or LIKE",
            "id": 95904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu sorgu neyi seçer?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>title</code> içinde <code>a</code> bulunan veya <code>year</code> değeri <code>1950</code> ile <code>2020</code> arasında olan öğeler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>title</code> öğesi <code>a</code> içeren öğeler</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1950</code> ile <code>2020</code> arasında bir <code>year</code> değerine sahip öğeler</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>title</code> içinde <code>a</code> bulunan veya <code>year</code> değeri <code>1950</code> ile <code>2020</code> arasında olan öğeler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>OR</code> ile birleştirilen koşullardan en az biri doğruysa satır seçilir.</p><p>Bir başlıkta <code>a</code> yok ancak yılı 2000. Gösterilen sorgu bunu seçer mi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" title \" /><text value=\"LIKE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"'%a%'\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BETWEEN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"AND\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Evet, yılı BETWEEN aralığındadır</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, başlığı LIKE ile eşleşmez</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, iki OR koşulunun da doğru olması gerekir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Evet, yılı BETWEEN aralığındadır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Same as IN 2",
            "id": 95907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu iki sorgu eşdeğer mi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Evet, ikisi de <code>year</code> değeri <code>1950</code> veya <code>2020</code> olan öğeleri seçer</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, <code>IN</code> eşdeğerine sahip değil</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Hayır, koşulları birbirine bağlamak için <code>OR</code> kullanamayız</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Evet, ikisi de <code>year</code> değeri <code>1950</code> veya <code>2020</code> olan öğeleri seçer.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir kitabın yılı 1960. Gösterilen sorgulardan herhangi biri bu kitabı seçer mi?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"sql\" name=\"script.sql\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"IN\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SELECT\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" * \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"FROM\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"WHERE\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"1950\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"OR\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"year\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" = \" /><text value=\"2020\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hayır, iki sorgu da 1960'ı içermez</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Evet, IN 1950 ile 2020 arasındaki her yılı içerir</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Evet, OR herhangi bir yılı içerir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hayır, iki sorgu da 1960'ı içermez.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: IN, BETWEEN, or LIKE",
            "id": 95906,
